settled Matthias 2026-11-07: bars 4-6, the "Fi-di" sixteenth pairs, A (Erk/Peters) has D4:1 D4:1 / B4:1 B4:1 / C5:1 C5:1, B (de.wikipedia) has D5:1 B4:1 / D5:1 B4:1 / D5:1 C5:1; Zitro plays the old print's version, and a crop of A's scan confirmed A.
